    "and sometimes other mappings too.",
    ".. data:: allTypes",
    "    A dictionary of names to types that will be exposed as attributes through",
    "    ``np._core.numerictypes.*``",
    ".. data:: sctypeDict",
    "    Similar to `allTypes`, but maps a broader set of aliases to their types.",
    ".. data:: sctypes",
